<title>UK: ZENECA NAMES AUTY R&amp;D HEAD, U'PRICHARD QUITS.</title>
<headline>ZENECA NAMES AUTY R&amp;D HEAD, U'PRICHARD QUITS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Zeneca Group Plc said on Wednesday it had appointed Richard Auty as director for research and development.</p>
<p>Zeneca said Auty was retaining his post as development director in a move to bring development and research closer together.</p>
<p>Zeneca said Auty would replace David U'Prichard, who is joining SmithKline Beecham Pharmaceuticals Plc as chairman, research and development.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
